  "solution": "Đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math> song song với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên phương trình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math> đi qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra phương trình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Từ phương trình của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>27</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>216</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi